      "title": "Ask the Resolver",
      "desc": "The laptop hands the question off",
      "detail": "The browser needs the IP address of www.example.com and neither it nor Windows has one cached. The laptop sends one question to the recursive resolver it was given, 8.8.8.8, and asks it to do the whole lookup (recursion desired).",
